				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-7872006/scp-100-jp#post-4018869</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 09 Oct 2018 13:44:18 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>RhettSarlin</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>300030</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Very nice.</p> <p>The idea of having a representation of Earth where changes to it affect our planet is nothing new, but I can't recall seeing one that represented other stars and such before, and the notion of having to protect it now that it exists makes this one feel exciting. Normally you just have to resist the temptation to experiment&#8230;but this one is just a &quot;holy crap don't let anything happen to this room!&quot; situation instead.</p> <p>Enthusiastic +1.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
